{"question_id": "S001", "question": "SUMMIT 2196 系列泵长期存放时，存放环境和泵轴转动频率有什么要求？", "primary_category": "参数查询", "strategy": "none", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 9, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-5ce75c93c0a1-000-5ce75c93c0a1"}, {"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 23, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05fa62ad30d3-000-05fa62ad30d3"}, {"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 12, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-847dedb676cd-000-847dedb676cd"}], "answer": "根据手册内容，SUMMIT 2196 系列泵长期存放时的要求如下：\n\n- 存放环境：应将泵存放在清洁、干燥的地方，并且不要取下管路接头盖。\n- 泵轴转动频率：至少每周用手旋转泵轴一次，以保持轴承上覆有保护油膜或油脂。\n\n如需长期存放，可向 Summit Pump, Inc. 购买专用护理产品。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 2750.0, "input_tokens": 814, "output_tokens": 94, "total_tokens": 908, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
{"question_id": "S002", "question": "SUMMIT 2196 系列泵的入口管路应如何选择和布置？", "primary_category": "参数查询", "strategy": "none", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 10, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-c99ee01e2d93-000-c99ee01e2d93"}, {"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 23, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05fa62ad30d3-000-05fa62ad30d3"}, {"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 17, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-d1faf220e6f2-000-d1faf220e6f2"}], "answer": "根据手册内容，SUMMIT 2196 系列泵的入口管路应按照以下要求进行选择和布置：\n\n1. 所有管路必须单独支撑，并与泵的入口法兰准确对正。\n2. 最好在与泵法兰直接相连的接头处放置一小段软短管或波纹式短管。\n3. 切勿用力将管路与泵法兰对正。\n4. 如果使用管路异径接头，应将其置于泵与止回阀之间（出口侧），但此条间接说明入口管路设计需避免应力传递至泵体。\n5. 防止空气渗入入口管路，如发现漏气应更换垫片（见故障排除表）。\n\n以上信息来源于《安装、操作及维护手册》中关于“管路连接 – 入口 / 出口”的说明。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 4563.0, "input_tokens": 776, "output_tokens": 187, "total_tokens": 963, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
{"question_id": "S003", "question": "SUMMIT 2196 系列泵出口管路中的止回阀、隔离阀和异径接头应怎样布置？", "primary_category": "参数查询", "strategy": "none", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 10, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-c99ee01e2d93-000-c99ee01e2d93"}, {"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 23, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05fa62ad30d3-000-05fa62ad30d3"}, {"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 17, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-d1faf220e6f2-000-d1faf220e6f2"}], "answer": "根据手册内容，SUMMIT 2196 系列泵出口管路中的止回阀、隔离阀和异径接头的布置要求如下：\n\n- 出口管路应包含隔离阀和止回阀。\n- 止回阀用于防止泵反向旋转，应置于泵和隔离阀之间。\n- 如果使用管路异径接头，应将其置于泵与止回阀之间。\n\n因此，从泵出口开始，管路元件的正确布置顺序为：泵 → 异径接头（如有）→ 止回阀 → 隔离阀。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 2547.0, "input_tokens": 785, "output_tokens": 128, "total_tokens": 913, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
