{"question_id": "S016", "question": "SUMMIT 手册中，轴承高温运行通常由什么原因造成，如何处理？", "primary_category": "故障诊断", "strategy": "none", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 14, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-8a9134f69b7a-000-8a9134f69b7a"}, {"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 16, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e39749fc478f-000-e39749fc478f"}, {"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 24, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-f14509fdd142-000-f14509fdd142"}], "answer": "根据《安装、操作及维护手册》18页的表7，轴承高温运行通常由以下原因造成及相应的处理方法：\n\n- 原因：没有对正。  \n  处理方法：重新对正驱动联轴器。\n\n- 原因：润滑油位低或润滑油不足。  \n  处理方法：检查油位和/或润滑脂。\n\n- 原因：液体比规定的重量重。  \n  处理方法：检查液体的比重。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 2312.0, "input_tokens": 912, "output_tokens": 107, "total_tokens": 1019, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
