{"question_id": "S018", "question": "SUMMIT 手册规定泵体和叶轮出现多深的凹槽、点蚀或磨损时应更换？", "primary_category": "参数查询", "strategy": "none", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 27, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-ac65104a0a87-000-ac65104a0a87"}, {"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 19, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-ef0141aa033d-000-6b0a2891be0c"}, {"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 24, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-f14509fdd142-000-f14509fdd142"}], "answer": "根据《安装、操作及维护手册》内容：\n\n- 如果泵体出现凹槽和点蚀超过 **1/8” 深**，则应更换泵体。\n- 如果叶轮的凹槽超过 **1/16”** 或磨损超过 **1/32”**，则应更换叶轮。\n\n来源：安装、操作及维护手册，SUMMIT PUMP 2196 / 2196-LF / 2196-R / 2796 型，第21页。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 2329.0, "input_tokens": 1569, "output_tokens": 117, "total_tokens": 1686, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
{"question_id": "S019", "question": "SUMMIT LTO 泵架的外轴承是什么布置方式，安装时还有哪些润滑相关要求？", "primary_category": "参数查询", "strategy": "none", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 28, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e112e31e2351-000-e112e31e2351"}, {"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 29, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-99d80f6fd8a0-000-99d80f6fd8a0"}, {"source_file": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page_number": 27, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-ac65104a0a87-000-ac65104a0a87"}], "answer": "根据提供的手册内容，对于SUMMIT LTO型泵：\n\n1. **外轴承布置方式**：  \n   手册中未明确说明LTO泵架外轴承的具体布置方式（如背对背、面对面等）的术语，但提到“确保轴承以正确的顺序、背对背安装”，这表明轴承应采用**背对背**方式安装。\n\n2. **润滑相关要求**：  \n   - 如果采用润滑油润滑，应**没有密封件或挡油环**。  \n   - 在轴承座内侧和外侧均需涂上一层薄薄的润滑剂。  \n   - 安装时注意排放槽必须朝下。  \n\n以上信息来源于《安装、操作及维护手册》中关于2196 / 2196-LF / 2196-R / 2796型泵的装配说明，适用于LTO型号的部分步骤。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 3953.0, "input_tokens": 1182, "output_tokens": 194, "total_tokens": 1376, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
