{"question_id": "D006", "question": "DESMI DNS 泵在霜冻期停用时应如何防冻？", "primary_category": "操作步骤", "strategy": "none", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 12, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全-2d7994f5896c-000-2d7994f5896c"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 35, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-0cdb66a95926-000-0cdb66a95926"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 4, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--目录-c493e2a39742-000-c493e2a39742"}], "answer": "根据手册内容，DESMI DNS泵在霜冻期停用时应采取以下防冻措施：\n\n在霜冻期不运行的水泵必须进行排水，以避免霜冻造成损坏。具体操作为拆卸底部管塞（3），排空水泵。或者也可以在正常水泵配置中使用防冻液。\n\n来源：手册“安全”章节中“2.8. 防冻”部分。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 2093.0, "input_tokens": 1353, "output_tokens": 89, "total_tokens": 1442, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
{"question_id": "D007", "question": "运输 DESMI 泵组时，吊运装置禁止固定在哪里，还应注意哪些事项？", "primary_category": "安全警告", "strategy": "none", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 13, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-时存放-d566b9b2e7f0-000-d566b9b2e7f0"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 48, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-卸泵组-d94509f9b71d-000-d94509f9b71d"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 12, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全-2d7994f5896c-000-2d7994f5896c"}], "answer": "运输 DESMI 泵组时，吊运装置禁止固定在泵轴自由端或电机吊环上。\n\n还应注意以下事项：\n- 始终在规定位置运输水泵（泵组）。\n- 监测重量数据和中心位置。\n- 采用适当、经允许的吊运配件，比如自紧式吊夹。\n- 装运前，将水泵牢固固定在托盘等结构上，防止滑脱。\n- 吊带不允许抵住锋利边缘和角落，以防损坏。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 2063.0, "input_tokens": 1009, "output_tokens": 111, "total_tokens": 1120, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
