{"question_id": "D009", "question": "DESMI DNS 系列泵的一般介质温度、最大密度和最大粘度范围是多少？", "primary_category": "参数查询", "strategy": "none", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 17, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-术规格-8feed9ec71ae-000-8feed9ec71ae"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 35, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-0cdb66a95926-000-0cdb66a95926"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 18, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-术规格-7318227c6dad-000-7318227c6dad"}], "answer": "根据手册内容，DESMI DNS 系列泵的一般介质温度、最大密度和最大粘度范围如下：\n\n- **介质温度范围**：未明确具体数值，但注意事项中提到：环境温度低于0°C时，应避免水泵冻结；若环境温度大于40°C或电机在海拔1000 m以上，可能需要调整电机功率。\n- **最大密度**：2500 kg/m³\n- **最大粘度**：500 cSt\n\n（依据来源：技术规格章节中的“介质温度范围”、“介质密度和粘度”部分）", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 2828.0, "input_tokens": 1015, "output_tokens": 128, "total_tokens": 1143, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
{"question_id": "D010", "question": "DESMI 手册给出的最小进水压力由哪些项组成？", "primary_category": "参数查询", "strategy": "none", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 18, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-术规格-7318227c6dad-000-7318227c6dad"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 24, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-73e13cfb6828-000-73e13cfb6828"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 10, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全-21ccbc8db89c-000-21ccbc8db89c"}], "answer": "根据DESMI手册，最小进水压力由以下项组成：\n\nNPSHreq + 吸入管工作摩擦力 + 液体蒸汽压力 – 液体表面压力 + 0.5 m\n\n（这是在特定水泵运行条件和特定泵送介质条件下不会导致水泵气蚀的压力。NPSHreq参见合同技术文件。）", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 1532.0, "input_tokens": 1115, "output_tokens": 79, "total_tokens": 1194, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
{"question_id": "D011", "question": "DESMI 建议泵前吸入直管段长度为多少？DN100 泵对应多少毫米？", "primary_category": "参数查询", "strategy": "none", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 21, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-cc20e38cbf4c-000-cc20e38cbf4c"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 21, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-2f479eae20bf-000-2f479eae20bf"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 23, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-23fbf21e5cf5-000-23fbf21e5cf5"}], "answer": "根据手册内容，DESMI 建议水泵前的吸入管长度“X”大约是管道直径的3至5倍。对于一台DN100水泵，相当于300 mm 至 500 mm。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 1172.0, "input_tokens": 633, "output_tokens": 51, "total_tokens": 684, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
{"question_id": "D012", "question": "DESMI 手册对吸入侧弯管、T 型管、弯曲半径和管道截面变化有什么要求？", "primary_category": "参数查询", "strategy": "none", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 22, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-4c0decacc13b-000-4c0decacc13b"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 10, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全-21ccbc8db89c-000-21ccbc8db89c"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 22, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-c79b53d407c9-000-c79b53d407c9"}], "answer": "根据 DESMI 手册内容，对吸入侧弯管、T 型管、弯曲半径和管道截面变化的要求如下：\n\n- 避免设置90度弯管、T型管或其他可能阻碍水泵吸入侧水流的部件。\n- 避免曲率半径小于标称管径的1.5倍。\n- 避免管道系统横截面突然变化。\n\n以上要求旨在确保吸入侧水流顺畅，减少气蚀风险并保护水泵正常运行。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 2360.0, "input_tokens": 640, "output_tokens": 107, "total_tokens": 747, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
{"question_id": "D013", "question": "DESMI DNS 泵管路支撑和进口侧流速有什么要求？", "primary_category": "参数查询", "strategy": "none", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 23, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-23fbf21e5cf5-000-23fbf21e5cf5"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 21, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-2f479eae20bf-000-2f479eae20bf"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 24, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-73e13cfb6828-000-73e13cfb6828"}], "answer": "根据手册内容，DESMI DNS 泵的管路支撑和进口侧流速要求如下：\n\n**管路支撑要求：**\n- 管道必须有独立的支撑，不能将任何作用力传递到水泵上，否则可能导致机封和轴承损坏。\n- 管道支撑的设计应涵盖所有可能的工况条件，包括冷态/热态、空管/满管、无压/承压状态下的受力情况。\n\n**进口侧流速要求：**\n- 进口侧管道内流速应满足：v < 3 m/s。\n- 注：若为分流至多台并联水泵的歧管，其内部流速应控制在 v < 1.5 m/s。\n\n以上信息来源于提供的《安装》手册内容。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 3203.0, "input_tokens": 1000, "output_tokens": 167, "total_tokens": 1167, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
