{"question_id": "D015", "question": "DESMI 手册中最大吸上高度 H 的计算公式是什么，安全裕度 Hs 建议多少？", "primary_category": "参数查询", "strategy": "none", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "citations": [{"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 25, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-17ce9c469745-000-17ce9c469745"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 24, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-73e13cfb6828-000-73e13cfb6828"}, {"source_file": "t1739cn.pdf", "page_number": 35, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-0cdb66a95926-000-0cdb66a95926"}], "answer": "最大吸上高度 H 的计算公式为：\n\nH = Hb - NPSHr - Hf - Hv - Hs\n\n其中：\n- Hb = 测压计显示的液体压头 (m) = Pb×10.2/SG (m)\n- Pb = 大气压力 (bar)（通常设为1 bar – 但也可以远低于这个数值）；在封闭系统中，Pb表示系统压力 (bar)\n- NPSHr = 必需汽蚀余量 (m)（从水泵的NPSHr曲线上读取数值）\n- Hf = 进水口管道损耗 (m)\n- Hv = 实际液体的蒸汽压力 (m)\n- Hs = 安全裕度\n\n手册中未检索到充分依据，无法可靠回答该问题。", "refused": false, "status": "ok", "latency_ms": 4469.0, "input_tokens": 1070, "output_tokens": 176, "total_tokens": 1246, "cache_hit": false, "retry_count": 0, "error": null}
